  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens huvudsyfte att leda till kunskapsutbyte, att f&#xe5; in fler
svenskar i EU samt bredda och utveckla den svenska resursbasen har uppn&#xe5;tts. Nationell Expert Jacob Tamm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of the initiative is to lead to knowledge exchange, to bring in more people
Swedes in the EU as well as broadening and developing the Swedish resource base have been achieved. Nationell Expert Jacob Tamm.</narrative>
  </description>
